><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250625110314+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250625110317+10'00'" name="a23cc791-593b-4d59-83fc-dc3a4e970d84" page="12" coords="59.981100,481.483000,433.155000,481.483000,59.981100,468.075000,433.155000,468.075000,59.981100,468.501000,433.184000,468.501000,59.981100,455.093000,433.184000,455.093000,59.981100,455.519000,433.152000,455.519000,59.981100,442.111000,433.152000,442.111000,59.981100,442.479000,433.193000,442.479000,59.981100,429.071000,433.193000,429.071000,59.981100,429.497000,433.203000,429.497000,59.981100,416.089000,433.203000,416.089000,59.981100,416.515000,376.367000,416.515000,59.981100,403.106000,376.367000,403.106000" rect="59.562100,402.687000,433.622000,481.902000" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-16.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>These days, one large portion of the time is spent setting-up tests, collecting and handling data. Machine learning, big data, automatic evaluation tools and systems enable streaming information to athletes on the go. As this technology becomes readily available to most analysts, the job scope will shift more towards the analysis and interpretation of the data, being more engaged in the recommendation exercise to athletes and coaches. &#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Increasingly, the analyst is seen as part of the swim team, supporting athletes, and</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="12" rect="493.228000,389.483000,677.228000,481.483000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250625110318+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250625110324+10'00'" name="0d14ec32-d07d-4526-9740-05bcfe0e3f19" page="12" coords="59.981100,502.236000,119.074000,502.236000,59.981100,488.607000,119.074000,488.607000" rect="59.555200,488.181000,119.500000,502.662000" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
